<title>LEBANON: SOLIDERE shares mixed on Beirut Stock Exchange.</title>
<headline>SOLIDERE shares mixed on Beirut Stock Exchange.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>SOLIDERE A shares rose and B shares were steady on Tuesday in reduced turnover on the Beirut Stock exchange (BSE).</p>
<p>A shares rose to $111.375 from Monday's $109.125, and B shares remained steady at $113.</p>
<p>Turnover fell to 5,502 shares, less than half the 12,633 traded on Monday, and value was $616,989.5 from $1,392,923.625.</p>
<p>For the second day running this week, there was no trade in the four other listed companies: Ciments Libanais, Ciments Blancs, Eternit and Uniceramic.</p>
<p>The LISPI stock index was up 0.29 percent to 83.81 and the BLOM stock index rose 0.78 percent to 959.48.</p>
<p>--Beirut editorial (9611) 353078 645456 602057</p>
</text>
